        <briefdescription>
<para>import model from Intrepid file format (see below for an example) </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>reverts node order of tetrahedral elements that do not comply with right-hand rule</para>
<para>Constructing tetrahedra from the tetrahedral element specifications inside of the <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_v_set" kindref="compound">VSet</ref> this method determines by volume computation whether the node numbering is incorrect. If so, the node order is reverted. </para>
